diff --git a/CHANGELOG.rst b/CHANGELOG.rst
index e166f03..54aff61 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+Unreleased
+==========
+
+- Rename ``expire()`` parameter ``time`` to ``now`` in ``TTLCache``
+  and ``TLRUCache``, so it no longer shadows the ``time`` module.  The
+  ``time`` keyword argument is deprecated, but still accepted for now;
+  it will be removed in a future release.
+
+
 v7.2.8 (2026-10-31)
 ===================
 
